<view class="card">
  <text class="title">媒体与文件（插件自带）</text>
  <text class="desc">选图、拍照、选视频、选文件、存相册、打开文档由插件内置，走系统自己的选择器。选到的文件以 wxfile://tmp/… 交给小程序：image、previewImage、getImageInfo、saveFile、uploadFile 直接能用。手机上两种来源都给时先弹「拍照 / 从手机相册选择」；桌面窗体开系统的文件对话框。</text>
  <view class="btns">
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="chooseImage">chooseImage</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="chooseMedia">chooseMedia</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="chooseVideo">chooseVideo</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="chooseFile">chooseMessageFile</view>
  </view>
  <view class="thumbs" wx:if="{{media.length}}">
    <view class="thumb" wx:for="{{media}}" wx:key="path" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="preview">
      <image wx:if="{{item.src}}" class="thumb-img" src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
      <text class="thumb-tag">{{item.kind === 'video' ? '▶ ' : ''}}{{item.label}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="btns" wx:if="{{media.length}}">
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="imageInfo">getImageInfo</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="saveAlbum">saveImageToPhotosAlbum</view>
    <view class="btn-o" wx:if="{{hasVideo}}" bindtap="saveVideo">saveVideoToPhotosAlbum</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="persist">saveFile</view>
  </view>
  <view class="kv" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="openDoc">
    <text class="kv-k">{{item.name}}</text>
    <text class="kv-v">{{item.label}} · openDocument</text>
  </view>
  <view class="result"><text>{{mediaResult}}</text></view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">宿主能力（hostApis）</text>
  <text class="desc">这些 API 引擎自己做不了。宿主在创建选项 hostApis 里点名的，调用经 hostCall 事件交给 Flutter，回包走 success / fail；没点名的立刻 fail，errMsg 写明原因。例子的 Flutter 侧给的是演示数据（支付、拨号、定位选点等会弹宿主自己的界面）；桌面窗体没接这一组，点了都是 fail。</text>
  <block wx:for="{{hostGroups}}" wx:key="name" wx:for-item="g">
    <text class="label">{{g.name}}</text>
    <view class="btns">
      <view class="btn-o" wx:for="{{g.apis}}" wx:key="*this" data-api="{{item}}" bindtap="callHost">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <view class="result"><text>{{hostResult}}</text></view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">宿主承载的原生组件（map）</text>
  <text class="desc">nativeComponents 里点名的标签由宿主用自己的控件盖在画面上，引擎每帧报位置与被遮挡的区域；宿主回传的事件派发到节点自己的 bind 上。</text>
  <map id="map1" class="map" latitude="{{lat}}" longitude="{{lng}}" scale="14" bindmarkertap="onMarker"></map>
  <view class="result"><text>{{mapResult}}</text></view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">剪贴板与振动</text>
  <view class="btns">
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="copy">setClipboardData</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="paste">getClipboardData</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="vibShort">vibrateShort</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="vibLong">vibrateLong</view>
  </view>
  <text class="hint">复制会弹「内容已复制」并发 clipboard 事件，宿主据此写系统剪贴板；振动发 vibrate 事件，宿主转成触感反馈。</text>
  <view class="result" wx:if="{{clipResult}}"><text>{{clipResult}}</text></view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">tabBar 运行时接口</text>
  <view class="btns">
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="badge">setTabBarBadge</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="unbadge">removeTabBarBadge</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="dot">showTabBarRedDot</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="undot">hideTabBarRedDot</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="toggleStyle">setTabBarStyle</view>
    <view class="btn-s" bindtap="toggleItem">setTabBarItem</view>
    <view class="btn-o" bindtap="toggleBar">{{barHidden ? 'showTabBar' : 'hideTabBar'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="result" wx:if="{{tabResult}}"><text>{{tabResult}}</text></view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">生命周期（切到后台再回来试试）</text>
  <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">App.onShow / onHide 次数</text><text class="kv-v">{{appShow}} / {{appHide}}</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">本页 onShow 次数</text><text class="kv-v">{{pageShow}}</text></view>
  <view class="log">
    <text class="log-line" wx:for="{{lifecycle}}">{{item}}</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <text class="title">系统信息</text>
  <view class="kv" wx:for="{{sys}}" wx:key="k"><text class="kv-k">{{item.k}}</text><text class="kv-v">{{item.v}}</text></view>
</view>
